@startuml MoodRefreshment_Sequence_Report
actor User
participant "ChatRoomScreen" as App
participant "Express API" as API
database "ChatMessages" as MSG
database "ChatReports" as REP

User -> App : Report message + reason
App -> API : POST /api/chat-reports\n{messageId, reporterUserId, reason}

API -> MSG : SELECT by messageId
MSG --> API : message row

alt Own message
  API --> App : 400 Cannot report own message
else Valid report
  API -> REP : INSERT ChatReports
  REP --> API : report id
  API --> App : 200 success
end

User -> App : View My Reports
App -> API : GET /api/chat-reports/mine?reporterUserId=...
API --> App : list of reports

note over API
  reporterClientKey exists in API/schema
  for device-based reports, but the app
  flow requires Login first (no guest login)
end note
@enduml
